# Stylesheets are stylelint's to format (see `format:styles` and .lintstagedrc).
# Both tools have opinions about SCSS and they disagree — most visibly on quote
# style, where prettier rewrites `content: ' '` to double quotes and stylelint's
# sass-guidelines preset then rejects it. Leaving styles to one owner keeps
# `prettier . --write` from reformatting SCSS into a state that fails CI.
*.css
*.scss
